erns, gem tassel drop earrings, pearl and gem layered necklace, delicate gold bracelets.\n\nSpeaker_1's Actions: She walks forward, turns to show the back of the costume and veil, turns back, gently lifts a corner of the gauze skirt slightly, and looks directly into the camera. Her hands and fingers remain anatomically natural. The dress, hair, jewelry, veil and headpiece do not change shape or color.\n\nSpeaker_1's Facial Expression: Calm and ethereal at first, then warm and direct in the final close-up.\n\nSpeaker 1 (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] 这是参考图一致性测试。请保持人物脸、发型、服装和首饰一致，并检查转身时背面和正面是否连续。</d>\n\nSpeaker_1's Voice Description: Young adult female, soft, clear Mandarin, gentle and slightly ethereal.\n\nSound-Visual Alignment: Soft footsteps on wet stone, light gauze fabric rustle, wind through leaves, and a faint wind-chime shimmer. Clear dry voice with no music. Natural lip sync, no overlapping speech.", 1344, 768, 124, "max"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 38, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 39, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio_vae", "link": 40, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 51, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "label": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "label": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_video_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0", "label": "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "ref_video_audio_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_audios.ref_audio_0", "label": "ref_audios.ref_audio_0", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "ref_audio_0"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "pro